<title>YEMEN: Turkey's Botas signs MOU for Yemen LNG supplies.</title>
<headline>Turkey's Botas signs MOU for Yemen LNG supplies.</headline>
<dateline>SANAA 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yemen and Turkish state-owned pipeline company Botas have signed a deal for annual supplies of 2.6 million tonnes of Yemeni liquefied natural gas (LNG) for 25 years starting in 2001, an official said on Thursday.</p>
<p>&quot;We have signed a memorandum of understanding (mou) with Botas to sell Yemeni LNG when its production and export starts in the year 2001,&quot; Muhieddine al-Dhibi, oil ministry secretary-general, told Reuters.</p>
<p>He declined to give further details.</p>
</text>
